msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:110
#: 1efa5d39cd4c47a0a01279c1c51c8e32 3b87e5c832fa46c6b75a70af4cf972d8
#: 60f90c47e5004ee5962b3ffe03a090ec 8c1e7016c15f4bc0aaed441433c196d5
#: 9769faa1ac324c67b8bd29a1587ef5a5 b36d867fb17647888146d3fa77324ed1
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, is passed by an inverter to RX2 (UART2 RX), which by default "
"is mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used for all "
"ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚经过反相器后接到 RX2（UART2 RX），默认映射为定时器输入而非 UART，支持所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 "
"CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（它们需要真正的 UART 连接）。但是，以此方式连接的 FPort 只能提供 RC 信号而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:112
#: 59a13022251e4f9b8fd1387eaae89fdb 6370be9b540e489ca9021e8da7be3063
#: a5a05003f6d14f86aa4299f92648e70b cdf647af295a429a99842a84532aa7cb
#: e75ab72024194ca8953413a2d1b06305 fcc9d3922d3041d4aa75a82892e5ae65
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the RX2 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART2 RX "
"pin for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL2 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"要允许 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机使用 CRSF 和内嵌数传，可通过将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为 「1」，将 RX2 引脚配置为真正的 UART2 RX "
"引脚，以支持双向系统，使其成为 SERIAL2 端口的 RX 输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:114
#: 339ab92ee6164c08acea535f74472c55 777e1121290a46a28ad15971c4b70c73
