"FPort requires connection to TX2 and RX2 via a bi-directional inverter. See "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 需通过双向电平转换器连接至 TX2 和 RX2。请参阅 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:120
