#: 5fafade790d84fdab3596195aa6a5451 e169eb30cdbd4f2bab01d3d39edc7619
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX2 connection, in addition to RX2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除需要 RX2 外还需要 TX2 连接，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:122
